cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: diar2meta
abstract: >-
  diar2meta drafts IMM-Core metadata records from local interview
  transcripts, for example the output of diar2. It fills what can be
  derived by rules, shows the evidence, and lists what a person must
  fill in or confirm. Python standard library only; no network access,
  no upload step. Consent status and access rights are never filled
  automatically.
authors:
